{"benchmark": "ifeval", "task_id": "1001", "sample_idx": 34, "model_name": "google/gemma-3n-e2b-it", "content": "Hark gentle traveler to the land of the rising sun! A journey most grand awaits thee a tapestry of sights and sounds beyond compare.\n\n**First Day A Tokyo's Embrace**\n\nUpon arrival in Tokyo a city bright and bold\nThou shalt find thee in Shinjuku a story to be told.\nExplore the gardens serene a respite from the fray\nAnd gaze upon the skyscrapers that pierce the day.\nDine on ramen rich a broth of savory delight\nAnd wander through Shibuya where neon lights ignite.\n\n**Second Day A Cultural Pilgrimage**\n\nTo Asakusa journey forth a temple's ancient grace\nSenso-ji's gate a sacred and hallowed space.\nThen venture to Ueno where museums hold their sway\nAnd art of ages past doth brighten every day.\nPerhaps a stroll through Ameya Yokocho a market's lively hum\nWhere bargains sweet and strange are surely to become.\n\n**Third Day A Hakone's Misty Charm**\n\nAscend to Hakone a mountain's verdant hold\nWhere views of Fuji's peak in majesty unfold.\nCruise upon the lake its waters calm and deep\nAnd witness art's reflection secrets it doth keep.\nA volcanic hot spring a bath of soothing steam\nA tranquil escape a most delightful dream.\n\n**Fourth Day Kyoto's Ancient Heart**\n\nNow journey to Kyoto a city steeped in lore\nWhere temples stand in silence forevermore.\nKinkaku-ji's gold a vision pure and bright\nReflecting in the pond a dazzling golden light.\nFushimi Inari's gates a tunnel red and grand\nA thousand fox statues guarding this enchanted land.\n\n**Fifth Day Gion's Geisha Dance**\n\nIn Gion's district wander where geishas softly glide\nTheir painted faces secrets they cannot hide.\nTea houses quaint and small a world of grace and art\nA glimpse of ancient customs held within the heart.\nPerhaps a traditional dance a captivating sight\nA fleeting moment bathed in pale moonlight.\n\n**Sixth Day Nara's Deer Delight**\n\nTo Nara's plains proceed where friendly deer do roam\nA park of gentle souls a welcoming sweet home.\nTodai-ji's Great Buddha a statue vast and bold\nA testament to faith a story to be told.\nExplore Kasuga Taisha lanterns row on row\nA path of wishes whispered soft and low.\n\n**Seventh Day Departure's Farewell**\n\nWith heavy heart thou must depart this wondrous place\nAnd carry memories etched upon thy face.\nOf temples grand and gardens serene and deep\nOf cultures rich and secrets that the mountains keep.\nFarewell Japan a land of beauty and of might\nMay thy spirit linger in my thoughts and light.\n\n\n\n", "logprobs": [{"token": "H", "logprob": -0.0029929152224212885}, {"token": "ark", "logprob": -1.3351351299206726e-05}, {"token": "▁gentle", "logprob": -0.516659677028656}, {"token": "▁traveler", "logprob": -0.009209651499986649}, {"token": "▁to", "logprob": -0.16942277550697327}, {"token": "▁the", "logprob": -1.052428126335144}, {"token": "▁land", "logprob": -0.3805307149887085}, {"token": "▁of", "logprob": -0.00017641419253777713}, {"token": "▁the", "logprob": -0.010221514850854874}, {"token": "▁rising", "logprob": -0.1512293666601181}, {"token": "▁sun", "logprob": -9.619726915843785e-05}, {"token": "!", "logprob": -0.2000569999217987}, {"token": "▁A", "logprob": -0.189360111951828}, {"token": "▁journey", "logprob": -0.09045463055372238}, {"token": "▁most", "logprob": -0.46313339471817017}, {"token": "▁grand", "logprob": -0.24842707812786102}, {"token": "▁awaits", "logprob": -0.05469677597284317}, {"token": "▁thee", "logprob": -0.020141830667853355}, {"token": "▁a", "logprob": -2.3945870399475098}, {"token": "▁tapestry", "logprob": -0.4897581934928894}, {"token": "▁of", "logprob": -0.14297157526016235}, {"token": "▁sights", "logprob": -0.8151241540908813}, {"token": "▁and", "logprob": -0.024518586695194244}, {"token": "▁sounds", "logprob": -0.011340916156768799}, {"token": "▁beyond", "logprob": -0.9126672744750977}, {"token": "▁compare", "logprob": -0.012260193936526775}, {"token": "